<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Clan Treasurer</h1>
<p>Usage (for the clan Master, or a member of rank 25):
</p>
<pre>cappoint &lt;member&gt; treasurer
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>cappoint fizban treasurer
</pre>
<p>A treasurer is a trusted member of the clan who may take money out of the 
clan's treasury (<a cmd='#'>Help Cwithdraw</a>). Any member can put money in 
(<a cmd='#'>Help Cdeposit</a>) and see how much there is (<a cmd='#'>Help Cbalance</a>); only the 
treasurers and the clan Master can take it out. A clan can have several 
treasurers. To take the position away again, see <a cmd='#'>Help Cdepose</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cwithdraw</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cappoint</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clan Quartermaster</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clan Master</a>
</pre>




</div>